Z||000017||88 Fiero||11-01-2000||01:43 PM||||Those headers....are they from FOCOA???? Looks like it...Shaun..as far as turbo headers...a member down here in Southern Cal got a custom one made for his '88 GT...with a custom turbo kit using a 300ZX unit on it...it's a 3.4 block and it also got a watercooled intercooler and it's automatic with a different gearing ratio...The car is wicked!!!! can leave a 6 foot skidmark on a 7 lbs of boost...they will crank it to 10 or 12 soon...||||reg||1
Z||000018||HYPTNOTiSE||11-01-2000||11:05 PM||||Those are certainly not focoa headers, i have a set of those on one of my fieros, focoa headers are a far cry from these headers. Focoa headers aren't very nice, but are better than stock manifolds i guess.  The nice thing about my setup is if you want to go to turbo later, all thats needed to change is the crossover pipe. And you can switch back and forth. Stainless is available too, but at extreme cost.<P>------------------<BR>       Mike LeCompte<BR>86 Fiero GT 3.2L w/ Nitrous<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.tcac.net/~daddyg/hypsig.gif"> ||||reg||1
